# Conformance probe pack for `rest` inside an `if` block (spec 0.21 ruling 18
# with ruling 5 of 0.8), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   p           one presence bit
#   if p.1      7 unused bits, then nums to the end of the message (val in 8
#               bits each)
format     conformance-extents-if
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence p 1
if p.1
  pad 7
  group  probe.nums rest
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
